    "axis": "memorability",
    "evidence": "The concentric vault/lock visualization, oversized thesis-like headline, and cyan/yellow evidence treatment create a recognizable forensic-lab identity across all three viewports. However, most of the lower section remains conventional dark dashboard cards and metric tiles, while the global header is a generic dense nav that becomes visibly clipped on tablet/mobile. The central vault graphic is distinctive but too faint and informationally static to make the screen genuinely demo-defining.",
